      "message": "Unified Fig. 6d rerun at common T0=Tref=15 uK with site-bound init + parameter audit\n\n- configs/continuous_fig6d_unified_T15.yaml: frozen unified baseline; T0 and\n  Tref configured as independent items; matched arm only; N=4096, seed 23003\n  (archived confirmation pool), dt=0.0125 us with 0.025 us paired check.\n- outputs/.../run_20260916_unified_T15: four formal curves (manual 200/400/600,\n  ML 400 replay) to n=60, paired timestep check, integrity verification (zero\n  initially unbound atoms, CRN bit-identical across waveforms, NPZ recount),\n  4-subplot comparison figure, survival/S(n)/loss-rate/metrics CSVs, 26-row\n  per-curve parameter audit, archive contrast recomputed against the current\n  vector reference, REPORT.md with reproduction commands and source hashes.\n- Result reported honestly: all four curves fail the ±0.02 engineering band\n  (RMSE 0.070-0.194); historical per-curve temperature picks (5/15/25/25 uK)\n  confirmed as fit degrees of freedom, not physics; no per-curve tuning added.\n- README: index entry for the new report.",
